<chapter xml:id="ch-expressions-equations" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Expressions and Equations</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>This chapter reviews expressions, with a careful emphasis on how the Order of Operations applies beyond arithmetic in an algebraic context.
      Expressions involving fractions, exponents, and radicals are covered.
      In addition, we solve linear equations.</p>
  </introduction>;

